OL,3,AHurricane Isaias downgraded after
OL,4,Amaking landfall in Florida
OL,5,
OL,6,FHurricane Isaias, the first of the 2026
OL,7,FAtlantic season, made landfall Friday
OL,8,Fnight along the northern Gulf Coast of
OL,9,FFlorida, bringing with it heavy rains,
OL,10,Fpowerful winds and the risk of
OL,11,Flife-threatening flash flooding and
OL,12,Fstorm surges.
OL,14,FIsaias is continuing north across the
OL,15,FSoutheastern United States after being
OL,16,Fdowngrade from a hurricane to a
OL,17,Fpost-tropical cyclone, the BBC's US
OL,18,Fpartner CBS News reports.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
