OL,3,AHurricane Isaias downgraded after
OL,4,Amaking landfall in Florida
OL,5,
OL,6,FFlorida, Alabama, and Georgia have each
OL,7,Fissued states of emergency amid
OL,8,Fwarnings of life-threatening storm
OL,9,Fsurge that could cause up to 9 feet
OL,10,F(2.7m) of flooding in some areas.
OL,12,FIsaias is one of three storm systems
OL,13,Faffecting North America this weekend,
OL,14,Fwith the two others hitting Mexico and
OL,15,FSouthern California in the El-Nino
OL,16,Ffuelled warm waters of the Pacific
OL,17,FOcean.
